-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.173</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πεπραγμένα τ. τὸ μέγεθος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.151</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">98</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τηλικαύτην βλάβην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PCair.Zen.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">378.11</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii B.C.)</span>:—<span class=\"gk\">τηλικοῦτος</span> is freq. conjoined with <span class=\"gk\">τοιοῦτος</span> and <span class=\"gk\">τοσοῦτος, νησύδρια τοιαῦτα καὶ τ</span>. <b class=\"lex-tr\">so small</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.70</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τ. καὶ τοιοῦτον σύστημα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">686b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τ. καὶ τοσοῦτος θεός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">177a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοσοῦτοι καὶ τ. θόρυβοι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.174</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τ. καὶ τοσαῦτ' ἀγαθά</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.24</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οἱ τ. καὶ τοιοῦτοι τῷ γένει</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Men.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Epit.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">120</span> </span>.</div></div>"}